 <details className="discovery-controls"><summary>Fine-tune products</summary><p>These controls refine matching collected products across pages when the bounded matching set is available. Follows match title text, not verified brands. Use “Remember these filters” to save followed and excluded words on this device. Use “Show more matching products” to display another page of refined matches. If exact counts are unavailable, narrow the selection or load more products. Unit prices group kg and L separately and never compare them against each other.</p><div><label><input type="checkbox" checked={photos} onChange={e=>setPhotos(e.target.checked)}/> Has a photo URL</label><label><input type="checkbox" checked={fresh} onChange={e=>setFresh(e.target.checked)}/> Checked within 24 hours</label><label>Follow brands or title words<input aria-label="Follow product words" maxLength={100} placeholder="Up to 8 comma-separated words" value={follow} onChange={e=>setFollow(e.target.value)}/></label><label><input type="checkbox" checked={matchedCatalogue} onChange={e=>setMatchedCatalogue(e.target.checked)}/> Only matches for my followed words</label><label>Exclude title words<input aria-label="Exclude product words" maxLength={100} placeholder="e.g. baby, dog (comma separated)" value={exclude} onChange={e=>setExclude(e.target.value)}/></label><label>Loaded-product order<select aria-label="Loaded product order" value={localOrder} onChange={e=>setLocalOrder(e.target.value as 'default'|'unit')}><option value="default">Keep catalogue order</option><option value="unit">Unit price within kg / L</option></select></label>{hidden.length>0&&<button onClick={()=>{setHidden([]);setLastHidden(null);}}>Restore {hidden.length} hidden products</button>}</div></details>
